<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en-us"><generator uri="https://gohugo.io/" version="0.161.1">Hugo</generator><title type="html">徐徐微风</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E8%A1%A8/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="html"/><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E8%A1%A8/index.xml" rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="rss"/><updated>2026-07-24T20:25:34+00:00</updated><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/%E5%93%88%E5%B8%8C%E8%A1%A8/</id><entry><title type="html">LeetCode 0001. 两数之和</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/leetcode/leetcode-0001-two-sum/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/leetcode/leetcode-0001-two-sum/</id><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><published>2026-06-15T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-06-15T00:00:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>原题链接：</strong><a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/two-sum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LeetCode 0001. 两数之和</a></p>
<blockquote>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="题目信号">题目信号</h2>
<ul>
<li>已知：数组中存在唯一一组答案，同一元素不能重复使用。</li>
<li>目标：返回两个元素的下标。</li>
<li>模型识别：对每个 value，需要快速查找 target - value 是否出现过，适合哈希表。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="首次思路">首次思路</h2>
<p>暴力枚举所有数对需要 $O(n^2)$ 时间。为了降低复杂度，可以在遍历时用哈希表记录已经见过的数值和下标。</p>
<h2 id="解法">解法</h2>
<h3 id="核心不变量">核心不变量</h3>
<p>处理当前下标时，seen 只包含它之前的元素。因此命中补数时，两个下标一定不同。</p>
<h3 id="步骤">步骤</h3>
<ol>
<li>计算当前数的补数 target - value。</li>
<li>如果补数已在 seen 中，返回两个下标。</li>
<li>否则将当前数和下标加入 seen。</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="代码">代码</h3>
<h4 id="python">Python</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">class</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">Solution</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">twoSum</span>(self, nums: list[int], target: int) <span style="color:#f92672">-&gt;</span> list[int]:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        seen: dict[int, int] <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> {}
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> index, value <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> enumerate(nums):
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>            complement <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> target <span style="color:#f92672">-</span> value
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>            <span style="color:#66d9ef">if</span> complement <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> seen:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>                <span style="color:#66d9ef">return</span> [seen[complement], index]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>            seen[value] <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> index
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#66d9ef">return</span> []
</span></span></code></pre></div>
<h3 id="复杂度">复杂度</h3>
<ul>
<li>时间复杂度：$O(n)$</li>
<li>空间复杂度：$O(n)$</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="易错点">易错点</h2>
<ul>
<li>先写入 seen 再查找，在 target 等于两倍 value 时可能错误地重复使用当前元素。</li>
<li>哈希表要保存下标，而不只是保存数值是否出现。</li>
</ul>
